    53	     explicit date bypasses any check placed in `default_as_of`.
    54	   - **The owner:** one function, `service.resolve_bound(conn, bound)`, receives every upper bound, explicit or omitted, in its
    55	     caller's read transaction.
    56	     - An omitted bound gives the last completed day.
